= Install JetBrains Mono

DevCentr Appearance supported alternate. OFL.

Same file on every OS. PlayTime binds `cli.install` for tool `jetbrains-mono`.

::: playbook [id="install-jetbrains-mono" shell="auto"]

::: choose [id="pkg-format" prompt="How should we install JetBrains Mono?" intent="cli.install" tool="jetbrains-mono"]
:::

::: step [id="install" intent="cli.install" tool="jetbrains-mono" bind="pkg-format" confirm=true]
:::

:::
